  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 104.04 Reference line",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 104.04 “Reference line” means for a surface water that is subject to RSA 483-B, the reference line as established under RSA 483-B:4, XVII.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100) #12801, eff 12-15-19; ss by #13945, eff 4-27-24 (See Revision Note #5 at chapter heading for Env-Wt 100)",
